{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日地震がありました。\n関東は地震がなかったけれど、\nみなさん大丈夫でしたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":".........\n個別握手会in名古屋"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの方が握手しに来てくれて\n嬉しかったです。\n個人pvで好きになった！\nという方がたくさん嬉しい。\n見てくれてありがとう。\nまりっか'17中毒者続出"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/15/5432081/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しろくまりっくまに伝えます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、乃木ここやBBJの感想も\nありがとうございました。\nMCもっと磨きます..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋の名物教えてくれて\nありがとうございました。\nあんかけパスタってなに？\nめっちゃ気になる...\n食べたいよーお腹空いたよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しい時間を\nありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4部 ゆる巻き"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/15/5432081/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カーディガン I am I"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ボタンの部分が1から5までの数字"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/15/5432081/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鮮やかな青色。いろんな色欲しいー\n見えにくいけど、\n作ったネックレス付けておる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5部 蝶のピンに小さいお団子"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/15/5432081/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シャツワンピ AS KNOW AS pinky"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これよく見たら水玉模様なの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/15/5432081/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もーかわいすぎて一目惚れしたのよ。\n形もきれいだし、\nやっぱしこの丈がすきです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/15/5432081/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"靴 gaimo"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新しい靴。これの白も買って、\nシルバーをもう一足買って\nお母さんが黒に染めている。\nだから3足。大人買いすげえ！\n履きやすいから\n夏にヘビロテしそうです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/15/5432081/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここでお話を"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/15/5432081/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと目を付けてた\n服があったんだけど、\nこの前買い物に行った時\nお店がなくて結局買わなかったの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でね、その日から何日か経って\nある日家に帰ったら...\nなんとその服がかけてあったのです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お母さんがかわいいと思って\n買ったらしい。びっくりした。\n親子だなー遺伝だなーって思った。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その服今度着よーっと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/15/5432081/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/15/5432081/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりに会った！\nゆきなかわいい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/15/5432081/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぴとってくっついてくるところ\n相変わらずかわいいー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/04/15/5432081/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}